Please provide the list of components and corresponding reference numerals to be included. Once supplied, I can draft a patent-style abstract covering:

- The device’s structural arrangement;
- Conversion or transmission of drilling-fluid energy into torsional impacts;
- Acceleration and periodic torque loading of the PDC drill bit; and
- Benefits such as reduced stick-slip, increased rate of penetration, improved rock breaking, and longer bit life.
